1
00:00:00,936 --> 00:00:03,556
As uke comes towards you 
and takes both wrists

2
00:00:03,857 --> 00:00:05,423
draw him in towards you

3
00:00:05,424 --> 00:00:08,299
take a step forward so his body 
comes round you completely,

4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:09,781
drop your weight down

5
00:00:09,782 --> 00:00:11,398
raise your arms up,

6
00:00:11,399 --> 00:00:14,653
as you do so, slide out to the space
controlling his wrist

7
00:00:14,654 --> 00:00:17,069
take a half step behind to his rear,

8
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:19,847
draw back and draw Uke towards you

9
00:00:20,448 --> 00:00:22,182
as you do so sit down,

10
00:00:22,183 --> 00:00:24,414
place his shoulder in between your knees

11
00:00:24,715 --> 00:00:28,586
the hand controlling his elbow 
slides up to control his wrist,

12
00:00:28,987 --> 00:00:31,244
your other arm control the wrist

13
00:00:31,245 --> 00:00:35,700
hold it close towards you body, 
turning your body towars his head for the pin.

